OL,3,CFirefighters in 'better position' as
OL,4,Cthey tackle Suffolk wildfire for third
OL,5,Cday
OL,7,FFire crews battling a large wildfire
OL,8,Fnear Britain's biggest nuclear power
OL,9,Fstation have said the blaze is
OL,10,F"stabilising", as firefighting efforts
OL,11,Fenter their third day.
OL,13,FSuffolk Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,14,Flate on Thursday night that they were
OL,15,Fin a "better position" than they were
OL,16,Fa few hours earlier, although they
OL,17,Fwarned that the blaze near Sizewell B
OL,18,Fwas still a "dynamic incident".
OL,26,@rD@AOUrD@MO]wD@FOUwD@VO]zD@MOUzD@^O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/13
