FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785482286
OL,3,CFirefighters in 'better position' as
OL,4,Cthey tackle Suffolk wildfire for third
OL,5,Cday
OL,7,FFirefighters have been tackling the
OL,8,Fblaze in Dunwich Heath, near Leiston,
OL,9,Fsince Wednesday evening, with more
OL,10,Fthan a hundred firefighters and a
OL,11,Fhelicopter on site.
OL,13,FThe fire is a few miles away from
OL,14,FSizewell B and the construction site
OL,15,Ffor the new Sizewell C, though
OL,16,Fauthorities said there is no concern
OL,17,Fof the fire spreading towards the
OL,18,Fpower station.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785482286
OL,3,CFirefighters in 'better position' as
OL,4,Cthey tackle Suffolk wildfire for third
OL,5,Cday
OL,7,FThe service said at least 12 fire
OL,8,Fengines will remain at the scene
OL,9,Fovernight into Friday in order to
OL,10,Fmanage smaller fires that are breaking
OL,11,Fout, adding that electricity had
OL,12,Freturned to 111 of the 116 properties
OL,13,Faffected by earlier power cuts.
OL,15,FEarlier on Thursday, the service said
OL,16,Fthe area affected had grown to 150
OL,17,Fhectares ` the equivalent of
OL,18,Fapproximately 210 football pitches `
OL,19,Fwith 18 fire engines and more than 100
OL,20,Ffirefighters at the scene.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785482286
OL,3,CFirefighters in 'better position' as
OL,4,Cthey tackle Suffolk wildfire for third
OL,5,Cday
OL,7,FIt also revealed that six fire
OL,8,Fappliances from London Fire Brigade
OL,9,Fwill be joining the firefighting
OL,10,Fefforts.
OL,12,FA statement from the fire service
OL,13,Fsaid: "Although the fire is dynamic,
OL,14,Fit remains stable and Suffolk Fire and
OL,15,FRescue Service is making good progress
OL,16,Fand confident that tactics are working
OL,17,Fand moving in the right direction."
OL,26,@uD@GOUyD@cO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
