OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785482286
OL,3,CFirefighters in 'better position' as
OL,4,Cthey tackle Suffolk wildfire for third
OL,5,Cday
OL,7,FSpeaking to reporters on Thursday
OL,8,Fevening, Freddie Gulliver, from the
OL,9,FSuffolk Joint Emergency Planning Unit,
OL,10,Fsaid there is currently no concern of
OL,11,Fthe fire spreading towards Sizewell B.
OL,13,FAround 50 people have been evacuated
OL,14,Ffrom their homes and a local holiday
OL,15,Fpark to Westleton, whose village hall
OL,16,Fnow serves as a rest centre.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785482286
OL,3,CFirefighters in 'better position' as
OL,4,Cthey tackle Suffolk wildfire for third
OL,5,Cday
OL,7,FMr Gulliver told journalists that the
OL,8,Flocal community has been "absolutely
OL,9,Ffantastic" in opening up their homes,
OL,10,Fadding only a few people will need to
OL,11,Fstay in the rest centre on Thursday
OL,12,Fnight.
OL,14,FHe praised the local people that run
OL,15,Fthe village hall, adding: "They've
OL,16,Fbeen absolutely brilliant at looking
OL,17,Fafter everyone, so I want to stress my
OL,18,Fthanks and gratitude to everyone
OL,19,Finvolved."
OL,26,@pD@ZOUqD@JO]wD@[OU{D@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
