SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785482286
OL,3,CFirefighters in 'better position' as
OL,4,Cthey tackle Suffolk wildfire for third
OL,5,Cday
OL,7,FSpeaking to residents, he said the
OL,8,Ffire service is "confident" it is
OL,9,Ftackling the fire, including by
OL,10,Ffilling trenches with water and
OL,11,Fdropping thousands of litres of
OL,12,Fseawater from helicopters.
OL,14,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham said the
OL,15,Fcounty's fire service will have "all
OL,16,Fof the support" they need in tackling
OL,17,Fthe blaze.
OL,26,@pD@QOUpD@[O]wD@aOUxD@OO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/13
