OL,3,CFirefighters in 'better position' as
OL,4,Cthey tackle Suffolk wildfire for third
OL,5,Cday
OL,7,FOn Thursday afternoon, an EDF
OL,8,Fspokesperson said the fire was "not
OL,9,Faffecting operations at Sizewell B
OL,10,Fpower station".
OL,12,FThe energy supplier said it was
OL,13,F"closely monitoring the situation" and
OL,14,Fit is understood Sizewell B has an
OL,15,Femergency plan in place that covers a
OL,16,Frange of scenarios including a fire on
OL,17,Fsite.
OL,26,@pD@`OUrD@NO]uD@AOUuD@bO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
