OL,3,CFirefighters in 'better position' as
OL,4,Cthey tackle Suffolk wildfire for third
OL,5,Cday
OL,7,FSuffolk County Council said Cliff
OL,8,FHouse Holiday Park, containing some
OL,9,F200 caravans, had been completely
OL,10,Fevacuated as a precaution.
OL,12,FLisa Gordon, 54, on holiday with her
OL,13,Fhusband and dog in their touring
OL,14,Fcaravan, evacuated from Cliff House
OL,15,FHoliday Park on Wednesday night.
OL,17,FMrs Gordon told the Press Association:
OL,18,F"Just looking at the pictures... it's
OL,19,Fquite worrying how close it is to the
OL,20,Fpark now.
OL,26,@zD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785482286
OL,3,CFirefighters in 'better position' as
OL,4,Cthey tackle Suffolk wildfire for third
OL,5,Cday
OL,7,F"It's a car, it's a caravan, and it's
OL,8,Finsured but at the end of the day it's
OL,9,Fa lot of hassle, isn't it?
OL,11,F"They are things that can be replaced.
OL,12,FBut it's not the relaxing day we
OL,13,Fthought we'd be having."
OL,15,FShe said that when she and her husband
OL,16,Fwere told to leave the holiday park,
OL,17,Fthey could see smoke behind the trees.
OL,19,FMrs Gordon added: "It was only as we
OL,20,Fwalked to reception to meet the police
OL,21,Fthat all of a sudden it kind of hit us.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@AOUuD@XO]{D@SOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785482286
OL,3,CFirefighters in 'better position' as
OL,4,Cthey tackle Suffolk wildfire for third
OL,5,Cday
OL,7,F"So where we were it didn't seem too
OL,8,Fbad at all. We weren't really
OL,9,Fpanicking at all.
OL,11,F"But as we got to sort of the
OL,12,Freception and the entrance, then the
OL,13,Fsmoke hit and we had to drive with the
OL,14,Fpolice through quite a lot of smoke."
OL,16,FThe fire service posted a video of
OL,17,Fdamage caused by the blaze, which has
OL,18,Fdamaged parts of RSPB Minsmere nature
OL,19,Freserve, showing blackened trees and
OL,20,Fscorched ground.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@AOUvD@eO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/13
