OL,3,CFirefighters in 'better position' as
OL,4,Cthey tackle Suffolk wildfire for third
OL,5,Cday
OL,7,FTemperatures soared across parts of
OL,8,Fthe UK on Wednesday, reaching into the
OL,9,F30s in some places.
OL,11,FGreen Party leader Zack Polanski
OL,12,Fcalled for Mr Burnham to host an
OL,13,Femergency Cobra meeting to discuss the
OL,14,Foutbreak of wildfires in Britain,
OL,15,Fincluding in Suffolk.
OL,17,FAccording to the Met Office, Suffolk
OL,18,Fhas only received 2% of its average
OL,19,Fmonthly rainfall for July so far.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
