SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785482286
OL,3,CFirefighters in 'better position' as
OL,4,Cthey tackle Suffolk wildfire for third
OL,5,Cday
OL,7,FThe forecaster said on Thursday
OL,8,Fafternoon other counties have recorded
OL,9,Fas low as 1% or 0% of average rainfall
OL,10,Ffor July, with Friday being the last
OL,11,Fday of the month.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/13
